;               CNFG.PRM
;               ========
;               ABOS parameter declaration file
;               contains all configurable parameters of the ".CFG" files
;               format of file:
;               1. number: parametercode
;               2. string: parameter line identifier
;               3. string: argument format string:
;                  I,i: integer
;                  X,x: hexadecimal integer
;                  K,k: short integer ('kurz')
;                  H,h: short hexadecimal integer
;                  B,b: binary (32 bit, leading zeros may be omitted)
;                  F,f: float
;                  S,s: string; all characters up to the next ' ', ',' or '\n'
;                  T,t: text; all characters up to the next '\n'
;                       s and t are followed by an integer designating the
;                       maximum length of the string / text.
;                  N,n: new line; parameters are splitted to next line
;                  #  : running number for more than one similar parameter
;                       sets with the same line identifier.
;                  capital letters designate mandatory, small letters optional
;                  parameters!
;
;
;===========================================================================
;
1  ver         IIS64
;
2  dimension   FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFS12FS12FFFFFFFF
;
4  edge_1      IIIIIIF
;
5  edge_2      IIFIIIIFFII
;
